{
  "name" : "Jenner2019 - Oncolytic virotherapy for tumours following a Gompertz growth law",
  "description" : "<notes xmlns=\"http://www.sbml.org/sbml/level2/version4\">      <body xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">        <pre>This is a mathematical model using a Gompertz growth law to describe the in vivo dynamics of a cancer under treatment with an oncolytic virus.</pre>      </body>    </notes>",
  "format" : {
